{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "029ass_401_2_4_029_01_09_a",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:5b090020d66ce24c85c39e93cf37b6b6d7654332c082064c950d1af01fc02361",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:029ass_401_2_4_029_01_09_a:2_4_029_01_09_a:cmd-000006:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0d161a1753544f1bf1d2d8060b7e3e2950918fcc103a2979fa4a27b2eced350c",
      "text": "吾主啊，分与我片刻的时辰吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:029ass_401_2_4_029_01_09_a:2_4_029_01_09_a:cmd-000008:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3ee08f1639b82fe68220d24961b6badce5fd21ac46a0e1b5ec7cad0c233098d9",
      "text": "听闻在美之馆内，有施舍食粮之地……\n有精炼术之间，我便前往了该处。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:029ass_401_2_4_029_01_09_a:2_4_029_01_09_a:cmd-000010:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7a5f24b38250b524685b596b32b4736dae7697bb8cb4f73cd57875ea56698dcf",
      "text": "受到该盛会的启示，\n展现出的食粮道道堪称至高。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:029ass_401_2_4_029_01_09_a:2_4_029_01_09_a:cmd-000012:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b2aa5c7616860a044152592e15c44787d91afdf9e430ebbc508fce0bbc5ee9eb",
      "text": "那特制的食粮，与司掌美感的万物……我再次窥见了\n贯通两者的秘密……！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:029ass_401_2_4_029_01_09_a:2_4_029_01_09_a:cmd-000014:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e29d05c756810230f5c212f15fde176cb586737cfe9f27cbf3cf7c71275d8567",
      "text": "请详细告诉我",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:029ass_401_2_4_029_01_09_a:2_4_029_01_09_a:cmd-000017:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5afd8a72917642e28eae6e87a451bcd43fe03608c77c6f6f7e07064a8a0c9066",
      "text": "无论是供品，还是司掌美之物，\n皆寄宿着创造者的灵魂！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:029ass_401_2_4_029_01_09_a:2_4_029_01_09_a:cmd-000019:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8c8c8d781438a23b1251b280b799a89fb6c0f911bbe4c0571967a474e604e2ff",
      "text": "触及那高贵灵魂之人，\n想必皆会同样由衷折服。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:029ass_401_2_4_029_01_09_a:2_4_029_01_09_a:cmd-000021:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:549784ad776412be8e5c0338b9300452d8e7862600469c8a5302d71684c05314",
      "text": "期间无需言语之诱惑。\n这便是供品与司掌美之物的真谛。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:029ass_401_2_4_029_01_09_a:2_4_029_01_09_a:cmd-000023:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:128fa83429ab54a964b86235d21b0db7b631ec02fba5c5aeac1f7852239d08ff",
      "text": "确实很相似呢",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:029ass_401_2_4_029_01_09_a:2_4_029_01_09_a:cmd-000024:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3fcdf33150d8b1f0e4d0f6b8884a216146fba68e31eb71df510cefa03a50c64e",
      "text": "阿斯兰先生也想传达\n自己的心意吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:029ass_401_2_4_029_01_09_a:2_4_029_01_09_a:cmd-000027:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d4b71a607e9a55a610de70342b35255f4022c6d0f0825c487f2d3da560e709ba",
      "text": "不愧是吾主，我的知己。\n而咏唱与舞蹈亦可视作同理。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:029ass_401_2_4_029_01_09_a:2_4_029_01_09_a:cmd-000032:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6138ae41777f65d3367cb1f420a2044273bd38ab631e08dfc057da710c0e3712",
      "text": "啊啊。该传达给暗之眷属的心意数不胜数。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:029ass_401_2_4_029_01_09_a:2_4_029_01_09_a:cmd-000036:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:da19dd8acd04173225761ac0279d90819e93783df00e4626e9e5a268bddd2bae",
      "text": "必须再次感谢引导我通向这一真理的\n“星空画布展”。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:029ass_401_2_4_029_01_09_a:2_4_029_01_09_a:cmd-000038:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:975cdbe7ea2db81ae46b852ac3b0457e4126c0c6d70706b4632f74a9e7536dbf",
      "text": "身为暗之巢穴的一员，\n我将倍加钻研，使灵魂更加熠熠生辉！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
